        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Door pivot hinges, Non-Handed Vistawall and Kawneer Doors.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nDoor pivot hinges  used for both flush face frame Vistawall  installation and Kawneer 1/8\" recessed door applications. Pivots replace most major door manufacturers.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSuitable for doors weighing up to 125 pounds. These pivots are engineered for durability, style, and are easy to install.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E11HE_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kawneer Pivot Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global TH1109 Pivot Hinge Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pivots for metal framed doors (aluminum framed doors)</li>\r\n<li>For flush door / frame and 1/8\" recessed doors</li>\r\n<li>Weather resistant</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum case construction</li>\r\n<li>Vertical height adjustment 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Full race ball bearing and design, provides smooth operation on bottom pivot door portion</li>\r\n<li>No sag, entire weight of doors rests on floor mounted pivot portion</li>\r\n<li>Completely temper proof, yet easily removable, replaceable in unlocked position</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Available in  Aluminum or Dark Bronze (Duro) finish.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a set (For 1 Door, see image)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
